## Production video server (split deploy)

- **App server nginx:** `https://admin.simfree.io/video-api` → `http://147.79.71.98:3004` (upstream `simfree_video`).
- **Admin env:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_VIDEO_API_URL=https://admin.simfree.io/video-api`, `VIDEO_PROXY_URL=http://147.79.71.98:3004` (Next.js rewrites; nginx also proxies `/video-api/`).
- **504 Gateway Timeout** on `/video-api/*` = app server cannot reach `147.79.71.98:3004` (videocalling down, `HOST=127.0.0.1`, or firewall). Fix on **video server**:
  ```bash
  ssh root@147.79.71.98
  cd /var/www/videocalling && bash deploy/fix-video-server-env.sh
  ```
- **Signaling** (HTTPS/WSS) goes through nginx; **SFU media** (UDP/TCP **40000–40100**) goes **direct** to the video server public IP.
- On the **video VPS** `.env`, `HOST=0.0.0.0` and `MEDIASOUP_ANNOUNCED_IP=147.79.71.98` (public IP, not app server IP).
- Open cloud firewall on **147.79.71.98**: TCP **3004** from app server `3.73.242.203`; UDP+TCP **40000–40100** from internet; TURN **3478** if used.
